*.apk
*.aab
coverage/

# Decompiled output from the original APKs. Excluded on two counts: it is ~44MB of
# generated artifacts that would bloat every clone, and it is decompiled third-party
# application code, which is not ours to republish. The written analysis derived from it
# (reference/*.md) is kept — that part is our own work.
_inspect/
reference/decompiled/
*.android.bundle

# Windows shell accident
nul
